          "_name": "content15",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section content15\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Counter\" name=\"showCounter\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Border\" name=\"showBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#f7f7f7\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"title col-12 col-md-12\">\n            <h2 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"align-center mbr-fonts-style pb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                Business <b>Solutions</b>\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"media-container-row mt-4\">\n            <div class=\"article article-right-border mb-4 col-sm-12 col-md-6\">\n                <h4 mbr-if=\"showCounter\" data-app-selector=\".article-counter-left\" class=\"align-center pb-3 mbr-fonts-style align-right article-counter-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n                    03\n                </h4>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".article-title-left\" class=\"article-title-left align-right mbr-fonts-style pb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Economic <b>Analysis</b>\n                </h3>\n                <p data-app-selector=\".mbr-text-left\" class=\"mbr-text-left align-right mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Ad culpa ea excepturi harum repellendus. Consectetur eligendi ex voluptate? A architecto asperiores deleniti enim est eveniet expedita obcaecati odit placeat voluptatem.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"article mb-4 col-sm-12 col-md-6\">\n                <h4 mbr-if=\"showCounter\" data-app-selector=\".article-counter-right\" class=\"pb-3 mbr-fonts-style article-counter-right align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n                    04\n                </h4>\n                <h3 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".article-title-right\" class=\"article-title-right mbr-fonts-style pb-4 align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Life <b>Insurance</b>\n                </h3>\n                <p data-app-selector=\".mbr-text-right\" class=\"mbr-text-right mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Ad culpa ea excepturi harum repellendus. Consectetur eligendi ex voluptate? A architecto asperiores deleniti enim est eveniet expedita obcaecati odit placeat voluptatem.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
